      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──总之接下来就是“菊花赏”了。\n为了长距离赛要加强持久力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb2a41ebbd8b01c826372017f2d4aef89a009208ec66555e8fe0eea503bfd9d",
