    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78fd15aeb8a42545a05ae75c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从时间上来说，就是下一次“菊花赏”\n结束之后，大致上流程就是这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e64c778edfc1c242a6cc61b9a69a51b570798e82592ed6460222276f55521c12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a6e82dcba460f3f9d7c8ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "国外挑战的“随行人员”指的是\n主要赛马娘的训练对手和商量对象，\n并担任辅助角色的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a4b1de9621702988d8db85ab704b4123da9cfb7750e1caa8c598148af32aeda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afa1930b09aeb7c200433362",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……不过还真是突然啊）",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c027b8ac90d84a4b0db7a678518e04f53652f665d2cc34058c33c5ad80f92dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070306.json",
